{"id":"664111","name":"蒸菜米米蒿","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/664111/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米米蒿","amount":"一把"},{"name":"普通面粉","amount":"少许"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"春天野菜米米蒿。","img":"images/664111/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"采摘新鲜的米米蒿。","img":"images/664111/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"择好的米米蒿。","img":"images/664111/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"洗净，沥干水分。","img":"images/664111/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切好，备用。","img":"images/664111/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"先放入少许油，拌匀，再撒上少次多量的面粉，均匀的裹上干面。","img":"images/664111/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"水开后放入蒸笼里，大火上笼蒸五分钟。","img":"images/664111/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"已蒸好。","img":"images/664111/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"蒜切碎，加少许盐捣成蒜泥，备用。","img":"images/664111/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入蒜泥，滴几滴香油。","img":"images/664111/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/664111/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"装盘即食。","img":"images/664111/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"颜色翠绿不粘坨，蘸上蒜泥更好吃。","img":"images/664111/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}